    "name": "World Meeting of Sufism (Rencontre Mondiale du Soufisme)",
    "id": "world-sufism-meeting-madagh",
    "description": "The Rencontre Mondiale du Soufisme is an academic and spiritual gathering held in Madagh, near Berkane, organized by the Qadiriyya Boutchichiyya Sufi order and the Al Moultaqa Foundation under royal patronage. It brings together scholars, spiritual leaders and international guests for conferences and debates on a different Sufism-related theme each year.",
